  "prompt": "For customers with customer_id from 3001 to 3100 (both included), show each order they placed from 1 January to 30 June 2025 (order_ts holds UTC time; use UTC days), and the customer's running revenue by day: the revenue of all the customer's orders on that UTC day and the days before it in the period. An order's revenue is its net revenue: net_revenue_eur in sales, summed over its lines. An order with no lines in sales is left out. Orders on the same day count together, so they show the same running revenue. Return four columns, in this order: customer_id, order_id, order_date and running_revenue_eur. Return one row for each such order. Any row order is fine.",
